==Strategy==
It is highly recommended to have beaten EoC Chp 3, gotten its treasures, and gotten [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]]. The clusters of enemies, combined with a lucrative amount of meatshielding means that Bahamut, even lower on a level, will chip away the enemies. [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] can work, but Valkyrie has less range than Bahamut, and as such less mistakes are allowed. Start by sending out your meatshields at the Ottas, and grind up money for your heavy hitter. Once you have Bahamut on the field, spam meatshields, and Bahamut will take care of the rest.

